# The git config fragments that hold an identity or are machine-specific. They
# belong in $HOME, never here -- this list is the backstop for the day one of
# them gets copied into the repo alongside the files that do belong.
.gitconfig.personal
.gitconfig.fao
.gitconfig.local
.gitconfig.backup-*

# ...but the templates are the whole point, so keep them.
!.gitconfig.personal.example
